These statements involve estimates, assumptions, known and unknown risks, uncertainties and other factors that may cause actual results or events to differ materially from those expressed in such forward-looking statements. Important factors that could cause actual results or events to differ materially from those expressed in forward-looking statements include, but are not limited to:

● | our recent merger with Flash Sports & Media, Inc. and our pivot from controlled environment agriculture to the sports, media, and experiential marketing industry;

● | our ability to integrate the operations of Flash and IPG FZ, LLC, including the Lanka Premier League Event Rights;

● | our ability to obtain stockholder approval of the conversion of our Series B Non-Voting Convertible Preferred Stock and related corporate matters;

● | substantial doubt about our ability to continue as a going concern;

